  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **The Grey King and the Silver Flame Attunement** (1 other source): The notes credit the opening song to the album Goths [1]\n- **I've Got the Sex** (1 other source): The notes list this song's album as unreleased, so it had no studio release on any album [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Beautiful Gas Mask**: rare: 8 archived performances [2]\n- **Night Light**: back after 68 archived shows (1959 days) [2]\n- **I've Got the Sex**: back after 26 archived shows (621 days) [2]\n- **Snow Crush Killing Song**: back after 26 archived shows (621 days) [2]\n- **Paid in Cocaine**: rare: 10 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tMG2017-11-10** (recommended): source not stated; 23 songs; 114 min [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tMG2017-11-10**: taped by Bryce Carr; transferred by notasfarwest; source: WAV > Audacity > MP3 [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by Greg Cristman Photo: [The Mountain Goats & Mothers @ White Eagle Hall (pics / setlist)](https://www.brooklynvegan.com/the-mountain-goats-mothers-white-eagle-hall-pics-setlist/) [3]\n- Poster by Greg Cristman Photo: [The Mountain Goats & Mothers @ White Eagle Hall (pics / setlist)](https://www.brooklynvegan.com/the-mountain-goats-mothers-white-eagle-hall-pics-setlist/) [4]\n- Poster by Greg Cristman Photo: [The Mountain Goats & Mothers @ White Eagle Hall (pics / setlist)](https://www.brooklynvegan.com/the-mountain-goats-mothers-white-eagle-hall-pics-setlist/) [5]",
